    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MedKGEval: A Knowledge Graph-Based Multi-Turn Evaluation Framework for Open-Ended Patient Interactions with Clinical LLMs
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+Y">Yuechun Yu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ying%2C+H">Han Ying</a>, 
      
