    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MoRA: On-the-fly Molecule-aware Low-Rank Adaptation Framework for LLM-based Multi-Modal Molecular Assistant
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yin%2C+T">Tao Yin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+X">Xiaohong Zhang</a>, 
      
